WEBVTT

49:00.422 --> 49:02.716
Gregor's toy,

49:02.841 --> 49:05.469
a wooden knight.

49:05.594 --> 49:07.471
Gregor never said a word,

49:07.596 --> 49:10.557
he just grabbed his brother
by the scruff of his neck

49:10.682 --> 49:13.977
and shoved his face
into the burning coals.

49:14.102 --> 49:17.731
Held him there
while the boy screamed,

49:17.856 --> 49:19.983
while his face melted.

49:24.571 --> 49:28.116
There aren't very many people
who know that story.

49:28.242 --> 49:31.828
- I won't tell anyone. I promise.
- No, please don't.
